### 1. Create first account
POST http://localhost:8080/account
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "iban": "LV80HABA0551000000001",
  "ownerName": "Janis Berzins",
  "balance": 100.00
}

### 2. Create second account (for transfer between accounts)
POST http://localhost:8080/account
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "iban": "LV42RIKO0000073123456",
  "ownerName": "Anna Ozola",
  "balance": 50.00
}

### 3. Get account by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/account/1

### 4. Transfer money from account 1 to account 2
POST http://localhost:8080/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountId": 1,
  "toAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 25.50,
  "note": "Lunch split"
}

### 5. Get transactions for account 1
GET http://localhost:8080/account/1/transactions

### 6. Validation check (should return 400 Bad Request - negative amount)
POST http://localhost:8080/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountId": 1,
  "amount": -10,
  "note": "Invalid amount"
}

### 7. Validation check - blank IBAN, short ownerName, negative balance
POST http://localhost:8080/account
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "iban": "",
  "ownerName": "A",
  "balance": -50.00
}

### 8. Validation check - valid account creation
POST http://localhost:8080/account
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "iban": "LV80HABA0551000000009",
  "ownerName": "Peteris Kalnins",
  "balance": 200.00
}

### 9. Validation check - zero amount in transfer (must fail, @Positive requires > 0)
POST http://localhost:8080/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountId": 1,
  "amount": 0,
  "note": "Zero amount check"
}

### 10. Validation check - missing required fields
POST http://localhost:8080/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Missing fromAccountId and amount"
}

### 11. Transfer to the same account (must fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountId": 1,
  "toAccountId": 1,
  "amount": 10.00,
  "note": "Self transfer check"
}

### 12. Insufficient funds check (must fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountId": 1,
  "toAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 999999.00,
  "note": "Over balance check"
}